    "chunk_text": "leafan sio weaxe\u00fe on wuda & lustmoce Dolhsealf eft, grundeswelge \u00fea \u00f0e weaxa\u00f0 on wor\u00feigum, sio bi\u00fe god to dolhsealfe, & ribbe & Eft dolhsealf god, acrind, adrige \u00fea rinde & swi\u00f0e smale gecnuwa & adelf ni\u00feeweardne slah\u00f0orn, \u00de\u00e6t mela bi\u00f0 god on to sceadenne. Gif \u00feu ra\u00f0e wille lytle wunde gelacnian, eacersan getrifula o\u00f0\u00f0e geseo\u00f0 on buteran, wyrc to sealfe, Dolhsealf, gearwan, gy\u00ferifan, singrenan, gotwo\u00fean l\u00e6st, gecnuwa wi\u00f0 buteran swi\u00f0e wel, lege Dolhsealf, mersc hofe, \u00e6\u00feelfer\u00f0ingwyrt & gy\u00ferifan & singrenan on \u00fea ilcan wisan wyrce. Dolhsealf, genim wades croppan & netelan, eac gecnuwa wel, wyl on buteran, aseoh \u00feurh cla\u00f0, do Dolhsealf, acrind, \u00e6fer\u00f0e, meodowyrt, adrige ealle & gecnuwa smale, asift \u00feurh sife, meng wi\u00fe Dolhsealf, gif mon sie mid isene gewundod, wudurofe, singrene, gelodwyrt, springwyrt, gy\u00ferife, Gif mon mid treowe geslegen sie o\u00f0\u00f0e mid stane o\u00fe\u00fee byl on men geberste\u00f0 to \u00feon dolhsealf, Gif men sie lim of aslegen, finger o\u00f0\u00f0e fot o\u00fe\u00fee hand, gif \u00fe\u00e6t mearh ute sie genim sceapes mearh Dolhsealf, h\u00e6sles ragu & holen rinde ni\u00feewearde & gy\u00ferifan, gec",
